# A Hawk in Repose (WotG 29) at Status 1 (a GM). The Gravestone's trigger plays nothing of the mission's: its
# DefaultActions message SEE_WEATHERED_GRAVESTONE (11341). Two Lilacs, a Bronze Sword, and a Lilac with a Bronze Sword
# each fail the exact match: no handler answers (no packet, nil), and nothing is taken.
lists BatalliaDowns/Weathered_Gravestone/onTrigger BatalliaDowns/Weathered_Gravestone/onTrade BatalliaDowns/onEventFinish/502 BatalliaDowns/onEventFinish/503
char zone=BatalliaDowns pos=151.228,-5.109,-395.121 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg AHawkInRepose current
charvar Mission[5][28]Status 1
item Lilac x2
item BronzeSword
login
trigger Weathered_Gravestone               # Status 1: not the mission's
finish-if-event
trade Weathered_Gravestone Lilac x2        # two Lilacs: no match
finish-if-event
trade Weathered_Gravestone BronzeSword x1  # another item: no match
finish-if-event
trade Weathered_Gravestone Lilac x1 BronzeSword x1   # a Lilac and another item: no match
finish-if-event
